※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 3208 LANG_ATTR_SEPARATE_LISTS

※ Everything one definition is told is written in one list.  Two lists say what
※ one list holding both would say.  (With a blank line between them, the first
※ is about the file and not about the definition: attribute-about-the-file.)
@[export]
@[visible]
let shared: u8 = 7u8

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    shared
